2026-10-02  Matevz Tadel  <matevz.tadel@ijs.si>

	* ta_init.C:
	New demo with two Total Annihilation units on a base plane, after the
	2003 macro libsets/TADemo/macros/ta_init.C that was never committed.
	The unit models and textures are game data and are not in the
	repository; the data directory is given as argument or in TA_DATA.
